# A downstream plugin symlinked in for local development. It belongs to its own
# repository; committing the link would hand every other clone a dangling path,
# and if the plugin ever loaded it would land in the GENERATED docs/reference/
# and break the drift gate for everyone without it.
/refimpl/racketmaximus/plugins/rcnt

